  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the system of linear equations<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />has a solution <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on the straight line whose equation is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "agxIK",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4J1RN",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "smgfK",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pgPc5",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> .........(1)<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> .........(2)<br /><math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> ........(3)<br />&nbsp;</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>For infinite solution,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Put this value in the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the equation of straight line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
